      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm kind of against this due to my personal experience with the pervasive nature of private messaging in another virtual world I've been part of for the past 17 years.\nLong story short: This goes against the social aspects that are the strength of VRChat.\nThere are plenty of people who would do nothing but 1 on 1 calls, completely ignoring all other users in the instance they are in.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-03T23:51:38.735Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Being able to quickly switch between a private vc with someone and the world chat would be very helpful. Lets say you want to keep in contact with someone you met *outside* of vrc because you arent always in vrc, you dont really wanna just give out your info to everyone in the lobby (whether its a discord or other socials). Sometimes worlds have secluded areas but there is no guarantee that worlds have that or people wont follow you there. You can go to private worlds but sometimes people get lost in the shift or dont hear you when you say you're leaving etc. The way i would like this implemented so people dont get constantly harassed is they would have to agree to this vc and anyone can leave at any time obviously. Thanks for reading!!",
